      "body": "## Motivation\n\nPart of #43304. The detokenizer router now exposes CPU usage through #43323, but its message throughput is still invisible. Add counters for incoming messages, incoming request output entries, and successful sends after grouping or broadcasting.\n\n## Modifications\n\nEnable these counters only with `--enable-metrics`. Streaming outputs count again for the same request. Control messages and idle batches contribute no request output entries. Failed sends do not increment the sent counter. Document these boundaries so the counters are not mistaken for completed requests or queue depth.\n\nThis covers the router throughput portion of #43304. It does not duplicate #43323 or implement worker identity, queue latency, or processing time histograms. Searches for 43304, detokenizer metrics, and router throughput found no open PR for these counters.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nOn DGX Spark, using the current source with an existing Python environment:\n\n```bash\nPYTHONPATH=python .venv/bin/python -m pytest test/registered/unit/managers/test_multi_tokenizer_mixin.py -q\n```\n\n23 tests passed, including repeated streaming outputs, grouped sends, idle batches, control broadcasts, and failed sends. The new regression fails against the original router implementation. No model weights or GPU generation were needed.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNo throughput improvement claimed. Enabled metrics add counter increments in the router process. The disabled path does not create counters. Full serving performance has not been benchmarked.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Changed files pass pre-commit.\n- [x] Regression and existing router tests pass on DGX Spark.\n- [x] Metrics are documented.\n\nAI assistance: implemented and tested with Codex. Human review is pending.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #38676674092](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38676674092)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38676673995](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38676673995)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #38676674001](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38676674001)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
